of the campaign.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.785
I won't even tell
ya what I think.

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:34.287
Just go look at the transcript.

00:07:34.287 --> 00:07:35.188
Get back at me.

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:36.556
That'd be the end of,

00:07:36.556 --> 00:07:37.757
that'd be the end of it.

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:38.691 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Can you imagine
that during a debate,

00:07:38.691 --> 00:07:39.625
if he just literally said,

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:40.426
I'm actually not even gonna,

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:41.928
I have two minutes,

00:07:41.928 --> 00:07:42.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not gonna talk for the
next minute and a half.

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:44.030
Google it right now.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.531
That would actually,

00:07:45.531 --> 00:07:47.433
it would crack the internet.

00:07:47.433 --> 00:07:49.602
- Google fine people hoax,

00:07:49.602 --> 00:07:50.570
those three words,

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.938
and you'll get all you want.

00:07:51.938 --> 00:07:52.772
- There you go.

00:07:52.772 --> 00:07:53.973
All right, Scott.

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:55.241 align:start size:84% position:16%
Let's talk about your
Locals community.

