00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:14.927
Cause it really is working.

00:08:14.927 --> 00:08:16.662
You've got a very
vibrant community.

00:08:17.964 --> 00:08:20.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Yeah, it's far
exceeded my expectations.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.869
It's way better than I thought.

00:08:22.869 --> 00:08:26.072
And the problem I was having
with the other social media,

00:08:26.072 --> 00:08:28.808
from YouTube and Twitter,

00:08:28.808 --> 00:08:31.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
