of work into something,

00:08:41.487 --> 00:08:42.989
that I have no control over.

00:08:42.989 --> 00:08:45.725 align:start size:97% position:3%
They can just snap a finger
and I'm outta business.

00:08:45.725 --> 00:08:47.693 align:start size:84% position:16%
So, I thought wouldn't
it be good to have

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:49.929
one place where there's

00:08:49.929 --> 00:08:52.431 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
only subscribers,
they wanna be there.

00:08:52.431 --> 00:08:54.967 line:0%
There are basically no trolls.

00:08:54.967 --> 00:08:57.670 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
Because trolls don't wanna
subscribe to something

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.272
