00:08:59.272 --> 00:09:01.307 align:start size:84% position:16%
So, it ends up being
this happy place,

00:09:01.307 --> 00:09:02.842
where you don't get
all the nastiness

00:09:02.842 --> 00:09:04.210
of the other platforms,

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.945
and I can't be canceled.

00:09:05.945 --> 00:09:07.113
It's sorta perfect.

00:09:07.113 --> 00:09:09.849
And monetarily it's been,

00:09:10.783 --> 00:09:11.717
like I said,

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.686
it exceeded my expectations,

00:09:13.686 --> 00:09:15.221
almost embarrassingly.

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:16.856
- Yeah, do you think that
the future of the internet

00:09:16.856 --> 00:09:18.291
is subscription based,

00:09:18.291 --> 00:09:19.759
as opposed to ad based,

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:21.827
or in effect that we,

00:09:21.827 --> 00:09:23.930
the free people are the product?

00:09:25.064 --> 00:09:26.799
- Well, if I speak for myself,

00:09:26.799 --> 00:09:28.834
I can't handle ads anymore.

00:09:28.834 --> 00:09:30.436
Not any kind of ads.

00:09:30.436 --> 00:09:32.672
I can't watch regular TV.

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:35.408
I just can't watch
anything with an ad.

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:38.711 align:start size:88% position:13%
So, even on YouTube I'll
pay the subscription,

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:40.346
so I don't have
to watch the ads.

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:43.115 align:start size:97% position:3%
So, I can't see other
people being that different.

00:09:43.115 --> 00:09:45.384
I think social media has,

00:09:45.384 --> 00:09:48.087 align:start size:97% position:3%
