collective attention spans.

00:09:48.087 --> 00:09:50.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, sitting there for
like five minutes of ads,

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:52.158
or even one minute,

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:53.793
of advertising seems,

00:09:53.793 --> 00:09:55.628
it just seems impossible now.

00:09:55.628 --> 00:09:56.862
Where in the old
days you thought,

00:09:56.862 --> 00:09:58.130
well, it's just a minute.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.532
- [Dave] Right.

00:09:59.532 --> 00:10:00.600 align:start size:88% position:13%
- And now a minute
seems like a long time.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.534
- I mean, a minute, man,

00:10:01.534 --> 00:10:02.768
when I'm watching YouTube

00:10:02.768 --> 00:10:05.071 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there's a seven
second unskippable ad,

00:10:05.071 --> 00:10:07.106 align:start size:84% position:16%
it's like, I'm
pressing that uh Roku.

00:10:07.106 --> 00:10:08.307
I'm pressing that button,

00:10:08.307 --> 00:10:09.909 align:start size:84% position:16%
over, and over,
and over, and over.

00:10:09.909 --> 00:10:12.311
Trying to buy back
a second of my life.

00:10:14.046 --> 00:10:15.615
- Yeah, I'm trying
to start a hobby.

00:10:15.615 --> 00:10:17.416
I'm like, seven seconds,

00:10:17.416 --> 00:10:18.250
what can I?

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.452
(laughing)

00:10:19.452 --> 00:10:20.820 align:start size:84% position:16%
- What can I do
with seven seconds?

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.955 align:start size:84% position:16%
So, one of the things
that I think is,

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:25.024 align:start position:0%
