you've done with your community,

00:10:25.024 --> 00:10:26.692 align:start size:84% position:16%
is you're putting
edgier content there.

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:29.729
Stuff that either you
kinda wanna test out

00:10:29.729 --> 00:10:31.197
with your own people,

00:10:31.197 --> 00:10:33.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
or you think maybe is
gonna bring you more flack

00:10:33.666 --> 00:10:35.568
from the normies.

00:10:35.568 --> 00:10:37.637
Um, what was the
idea behind that?

00:10:39.205 --> 00:10:41.273 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah, there's some
types of content,

00:10:41.273 --> 00:10:43.275
that if you put it out
in the general public,

00:10:43.275 --> 00:10:45.378
it just attracts trolls.

00:10:45.378 --> 00:10:47.813 align:start size:88% position:13%
But if I'm in my
subscription community,

00:10:47.813 --> 00:10:50.182 align:start size:84% position:16%
it's only people who
want to be there.

00:10:50.182 --> 00:10:54.620
So, people, they may comment
