00:11:13.039 --> 00:11:13.973
and they don't.

00:11:13.973 --> 00:11:15.241
Weirdly.

00:11:15.241 --> 00:11:16.409
That's amazing too.

00:11:16.409 --> 00:11:18.678
Imagine thousands of people,

00:11:18.678 --> 00:11:20.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I say this would
really get me in trouble,

00:11:20.946 --> 00:11:22.682
don't put this on the internet,

00:11:22.682 --> 00:11:23.849
and they don't.

00:11:23.849 --> 00:11:24.950
They don't.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:25.885
(chuckling)

00:11:25.885 --> 00:11:27.486
Now, none of it would kill me.

00:11:27.486 --> 00:11:28.754
So, I'm not gonna
