That in a certain way,

00:13:02.047 --> 00:13:03.582
this election almost feels
like the end of everything.

00:13:03.582 --> 00:13:06.085
The debates feel like
the end of the debates.

00:13:06.085 --> 00:13:09.221
I feel like we've taken
